Cubi 2 - licence overview
=========================

Cubi 2 is free for everyone: to use, study, copy, change, build, share and sell,
for any purpose, as long as the name "Cubi 2" and its authors are credited.

  Code  ->  MIT License         (below)
  CAD, drawings, documents, images            ->  CC BY 4.0           (see LICENSE-CAD.md)
  Third-party models in CAD/hardware/                ->  their own licences  (CAD/hardware/SOURCES.txt)

Please also read RESPECT.md: how the project asks to be treated, and the safety
note for schools.


